          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Dashboard — Populated (today's kata, blind)\n- Dashboard — First visit + onboarding overlay\n- Dashboard / Mobile — Today · blind (bottom nav)\n- Dashboard — Load error (inline ErrorState with retry)\n- Dashboard / Mobile — Done today + one more",
