          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lP77n",
          "name": "Heading 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-accent",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C1wUu4",
          "name": "Body 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Hero has three states by priority: active session > done today > empty; first visit swaps copy only (TodayCard.tsx)\n- With micro kata on the instance (dailyKataMinutes), the empty state is blind: 'Today · ~5 min', no topic; Enter the dojo starts today's kata in one tap (POST /sessions/daily, D53). Without micro kata it routes to /katas as before\n- Today's kata is fixed per learner and day on the server, so there is no reroll; Done today adds One more kata, never one already practiced today (D54)\n- Hero buttons are full width below md\n- isFirstVisit = streak 0 and no recent sessions (DashboardPage.tsx:25); overlay shows once per device ('dojo-onboarding-seen')\n- Patterns and Weak areas need totalCompleted >= 3; Recent kata hides when empty\n- Streak = consecutive UTC days ending today or yesterday (query-helpers.ts:21)",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VEUiU",
          "name": "Heading 5. COPY SOURCE",
          "fill": "$color-accent",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5. COPY SOURCE",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
